---
source: crates/daemon/tests/cli_help.rs
expression: stdout
---
Always or never file mail from this email's sender

Usage: mxr records sender [OPTIONS] <MESSAGE_ID>

Arguments:
  <MESSAGE_ID>

Options:
      --always
      --never
      --clear              Let the rules decide again
      --kind <KIND>        The kind "always" files as
      --dry-run
      --account <ACCOUNT>  Limit to one account; the default covers every account
      --format <FORMAT>    [possible values: table, json, jsonl, csv, ids]
  -h, --help               Print help
